### camtel-app (frontend) ###
# Both regenerate with a single command (npm install / npm run build) and
# don't belong in git — node_modules alone was previously ~7800 tracked
# files. /dist/ above only anchors to the repo root, so it never actually
# caught camtel-app/dist; this unanchored rule catches it (and any other
# nested dist/) explicitly.
node_modules/
camtel-app/dist/

### Generated report PDFs ###
# report.storage-dir in application.properties — written at runtime, not
# source.
/reports/

### Environment secrets ###
# Every .env (backend and camtel-app/.env alike) holds real credentials and
# must never be committed — each clone/branch needs its own copy, added back
# manually from the matching .env.example. The example files themselves are
# meant to be committed, so they're explicitly un-ignored below.
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
